  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"d7Olw\" id=\"d7Olw\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdf8fc89\" id=\"ucdf8fc89\">通配符</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22test%3A%20a.o%20b.o%20c.o%5Cn%5Ctgcc%20-o%20test%20%24%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%25.o%20%3A%20%25.c%5Cn%5Ctgcc%20-c%20-o%20%24%40%20%24%3C%5Cnclean%3A%5Cn%5Ctrm%20-rf%20*.o%20test%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hUjrB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u70a62003\" id=\"u70a62003\"><code data-lake-id=\"u13df3947\" id=\"u13df3947\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3908303a\" id=\"u3908303a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">%.o</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uad61a853\" id=\"uad61a853\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：表示所用的.o文件</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u958fa4d9\" id=\"u958fa4d9\"><code data-lake-id=\"u03f254e8\" id=\"u03f254e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua34d0f5a\" id=\"ua34d0f5a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">%.c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u28769ca2\" id=\"u28769ca2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：表示所有的.c文件</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e3e73c3\" id=\"u8e3e73c3\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc3abba3d\" id=\"uc3abba3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc87a302d\" id=\"uc87a302d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">$@</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u55e95bf2\" id=\"u55e95bf2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：表示目标</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u192ced86\" id=\"u192ced86\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5d55edcb\" id=\"u5d55edcb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8cfe8abc\" id=\"u8cfe8abc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">$&lt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7342cff7\" id=\"u7342cff7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：表示第1个依赖文件</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud9c34705\" id=\"ud9c34705\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4dc1659e\" id=\"u4dc1659e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2131d02\" id=\"ua2131d02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">$^</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf7780389\" id=\"uf7780389\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：表示所有依赖文件</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"kNBoO\" id=\"kNBoO\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ec42998\" id=\"u0ec42998\">假想目标.PYONY</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u75e69761\" id=\"u75e69761\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61648846\" id=\"u61648846\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">如果当前目录已存在和任务名称相同的文件，则任务不会被执行。可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u582bd494\" id=\"u582bd494\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucac4a4d9\" id=\"ucac4a4d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">.PYONY</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue6e5a5f0\" id=\"ue6e5a5f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">解决</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u4a7e2d03\" id=\"u4a7e2d03\"><p data-lake-id=\"u623305d0\" id=\"u623305d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21e4cbba\" id=\"u21e4cbba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">目录下存在clean文件</span></p></blockquote><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22test%3A%20a.o%20b.o%20c.o%5Cn%5Ctgcc%20-o%20test%20%24%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%25.o%20%3A%20%25.c%5Cn%5Ctgcc%20-c%20-o%20%24%40%20%24%3C%5Cn%5Cnclean%3A%5Cn%5Ctrm%20*.o%20test%5Cn%5Cn.PHONY%3A%20clean%5Ct%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22odhbd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"UVkle\" id=\"UVkle\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b569833\" id=\"u8b569833\">变量</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u97db8a8b\" id=\"u97db8a8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84cda125\" id=\"u84cda125\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在Makefile中常见的变量有两种:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee85c356\" id=\"uee85c356\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ac68e48\" id=\"u8ac68e48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1) 简单变量(即时变量)：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u59c09f33\" id=\"u59c09f33\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua7a16cd4\" id=\"ua7a16cd4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7aafb8fa\" id=\"u7aafb8fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">A := xxx</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1f550e8a\" id=\"u1f550e8a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">  A的值即刻确定，在定义时即确定</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4da44cf5\" id=\"u4da44cf5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u309cbd03\" id=\"u309cbd03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于即使变量使用 “</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8228955d\" id=\"u8228955d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29300a6b\" id=\"u29300a6b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">:=</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7bcc5001\" id=\"u7bcc5001\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">” 表示，它的值在定义的时候已经被确定了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3bc7e462\" id=\"u3bc7e462\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b3896dd\" id=\"u4b3896dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2）延时变量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua5f7344c\" id=\"ua5f7344c\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud7979871\" id=\"ud7979871\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4c6eb08\" id=\"ud4c6eb08\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">B = xxx</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5ec53f81\" id=\"u5ec53f81\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> B的值使用到时才确定</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5667d041\" id=\"u5667d041\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4c62344\" id=\"uc4c62344\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于延时变量使用“</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf629de46\" id=\"uf629de46\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8024fdeb\" id=\"u8024fdeb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">=</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub58e7ec6\" id=\"ub58e7ec6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">”表示。它只有在使用到的时候才确定，在定义/等于时并没有确定下来。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22A%20%3A%3D%20%24(C)%5CnB%20%3D%20%24(C)%5CnC%20%3D%20abc%5Cn%5Cn%23D%20%3D%20itcast%5CnD%20%3A%3D%20itcast%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20A%20%3D%20%24(A)%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20B%20%3D%20%24(B)%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20D%20%3D%20%24(D)%5Cn%5CnC%20%2B%3D%20123%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HTceu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
